  "project_description": "Back to top \n\n Description \n Makes Wikiloc fields available to show trials and waypoints from the service http://es.wikiloc.com/ \n\n Back to top \n\n Installation \n Install as you would normally install a contributed drupal module. See:\n\n https://drupal.org/documentation/install/modules-themes/modules-7 \n\nfor further information.\n\n 1. Extract module archive in \"sites/all/modules\".\n\n2. Enable module \"WikiLoc\".\n\n3. Add the new field.\n\n Back to top \n\n Configuration \n In Structure>Content Types>Type>Manage Fields add new field type wikiloc\n\nand that's all ;)\n\n Back to top",
